    "abstract": "The major work in the field of printing exposure determination is reviewed, and a bibliography is included. A new concept in the use of integrated transmittance in automatically determining printing exposures for color materials is discussed. This method entails the use of an optimum correction level for any given negative or transparency population. This correction level is a compromise between the incompatible correction requirements of various segments of the population.",
